# PerkFixesAndRebalance workflow

Details: personal skills `bannerlord-deploy-watcher` (build/deploy) and
`bannerlord-release` (version bump, zip). This rule is the always-on summary.

- **Module:** `PerkFixesAndRebalance`, deployed to
  `D:\SteamLibrary\steamapps\common\Mount & Blade II Bannerlord\Modules\PerkFixesAndRebalance`.
- **Deploy** every finished change that builds. Build with `-p:SkipBannerlordDeploy=true`,
  copy `SubModule.xml` and the DLL/PDB into the module folder, and if the DLL is locked
  run `"D:\Games\Bannerlord\Mod-dev\PerkFixesAndRebalance\tools\deploy-watcher.ps1" -Once`
  in the agent Shell (`block_until_ms: 0`, `notify_on_output` `DEPLOYED|UP TO DATE|FAILED|MISMATCH`).
- If Auto-review blocks a build, copy, or watcher call, retry that same call with
  approval. Do not drop the deploy.
- Never `Start-Process` a watcher, and never poll or `AwaitShell` for it. End the
  turn after starting it. Confirm in chat after any deploy.
- **Commit after every finished change** that builds. Stage only the files you
  changed (`git add <paths>`, `git commit -- <paths>`); the tree can hold other
  uncommitted work. No push or amend unless asked.
- **Version bumps and release zips only when asked.** `dist/` stays gitignored.
  Remove debug logging and stray log files (repo and module folder) before zipping.
- Work only in this repo. Never run or edit another mod's watcher or files.
